# **`52_raster_font.lc` (Rasterization Engine & Font Definition)**
# **Purpose**: Pure functional pixel rendering, unicode glyph definitions, and font generation.
# **Contents**:
# Framebuffer canvas abstractions (`make_canvas`, `set_pixel`, `get_pixel`).
# Vector-to-raster scanline conversion algorithms.
# Unicode symbol path definitions and font rendering engine (`render_text_to_canvas`).

